@startuml twoplayer-ui-class
' #7 후: Mode 메뉴와 2인용 진입점 (007-two-player-ui.md). 근거: ui/ModeSwitch.java, ui/GameMode.java, ui/ClassicMode.java,
' ui/SinglePlayerMode.java, ui/LifeFrame.java, ui/GameMenu.java, twoplayer/TwoPlayerSession.java, twoplayer/ui/*.java
' 2026-11-25 갱신 (origin/main 2c22cab): GameMenu.install 삭제(#102, ui/docs/011),
' Classic / Single Player 분리(#109, ui/docs/012), Neighborhood 전이 상태 보드별(#74). 007 "이후 변경".
' 공개(public) 타입은 흰색, package-private 타입은 회색.
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK KR"
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
set separator none
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #444444
  ArrowColor #444444
}
skinparam class<<package-private>> {
  BackgroundColor #EEEEEE
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFBE6
  BorderColor #C9B458
}

title 2인용 UI 통합 후 (이슈 7, 11/25 기준): Mode 메뉴(Classic / Single Player / 2 Players)와 2인용 진입점

package com.holub.life.ui {
  class LifeFrame
  class BoardPanel
  class GameMenu {
    + {static} installMenus(panel, active, clock, presetController, placement)
    + {static} setFileCommandsEnabled(panel, enabled)
    + {static} setPresetsEnabled(panel, controller, enabled)
  }
  interface GameMode {
    + menuName() : String
    + view() : JComponent
    + tick()
    + supportsFileCommands() : boolean
  }
  class ModeSwitch {
    - tickLock : Object
    - current : GameMode
    + select(mode)
    + add(mode)
    + view() : JComponent
    - tick()
  }
  class ClassicMode
  class SinglePlayerMode
}

package com.holub.life.application {
  class Clock
  class GameController
}

package com.holub.life.twoplayer {
  class TwoPlayerSession {
    + click(row, column) : Response
    + confirm() / pass() : Response
    + tick() : boolean
    + newGame()
    + status() : String
    + snapshot() : Snapshot
    + addListener(listener)
  }
  class TwoPlayerGame
  class NeighborhoodTwoPlayerBoard
}

package com.holub.life.twoplayer.ui {
  class TwoPlayerMode
  class TwoPlayerPanel <<package-private>>
  class TwoPlayerRenderer <<package-private>> {
    ~ {static} render(g, here, snapshot)
  }
}

LifeFrame ..> GameMenu : installMenus\n(Grid는 지금 모드의 컨트롤러로)
LifeFrame *-- ModeSwitch
LifeFrame ..> TwoPlayerMode : Mode 메뉴 (Life가 넘김)
ModeSwitch o-- "1..*" GameMode
ModeSwitch --> Clock : 리스너 1개, stop()
GameMode <|.. ClassicMode
GameMode <|.. SinglePlayerMode
GameMode <|.. TwoPlayerMode
ClassicMode --> BoardPanel : view
ClassicMode --> GameController : tick (원본 B3/S23)
SinglePlayerMode --> BoardPanel : view
SinglePlayerMode --> GameController : tick (암세포 게임)
TwoPlayerMode *-- TwoPlayerSession
TwoPlayerMode *-- TwoPlayerPanel
TwoPlayerPanel --> TwoPlayerSession : 클릭·확정·패스·새 게임, 리스너
TwoPlayerPanel ..> TwoPlayerRenderer
TwoPlayerSession *-- TwoPlayerGame
TwoPlayerSession *-- NeighborhoodTwoPlayerBoard

note top of ModeSwitch
  모든 모드의 tick과 select()가
  tickLock 하나 안에서 돈다.
  한 번에 한 모드의 보드만 진행한다
  (앱 실행 정책. #74 수정 뒤 모델 잠금은 보드별).
end note
note bottom of TwoPlayerRenderer
  세션 스냅숏(소유자 64×64)만 그린다.
  Neighborhood의 읽기 허가를 쓰지 않는다.
end note
note bottom of TwoPlayerMode
  supportsFileCommands() = false:
  2인용에서 Clear·Load·Store 꺼짐.
  Preset은 Single Player에서만 켜짐.
end note
@enduml
